---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-12 - Withdraw Consent
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor STU as Student
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as ConsentsController
    participant S as ConsentService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    STU->>W: Click "Withdraw" on one attribute
    W->>C: PUT /api/Consents/{id}/withdraw
    C->>S: WithdrawAsync(StudentId, ConsentId)
    S->>R: Load own granted consent
    S->>R: PrepareUpdate status = withdrawn, withdrawnAt = now, PrepareCreate ConsentHistory (granted -> withdrawn)
    S->>R: Is the attribute still granted under another purpose? Has the student an active key for it?
    opt no other grant and an active key exists
        S->>R: PrepareCreate ErasureRequest (pending)
    end
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE CONSENTS, INSERT CONSENTHISTORIES, ERASUREREQUESTS
    opt erasure queued
        S->>N: NotifyAsync(each Steward, "Erasure request waiting")
    end
    S-->>C: true
    C-->>W: 200 OK
    Note over W,DB: The next read by staff is refused by the access guard ("exists, not shared")
